</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Optimal planning in large multi-site production networks</article-title><source>Eur J Oper Res</source><year>2000</year><volume>126</volume><fpage>422</fpage><lpage>435</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0377-2217(99)00301-X</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Almansoori</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Design and operation of a future hydrogen supply chain</article-title><source>PhD thesis</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>Imperial College London</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McCarl</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Meeraus</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Eijk</surname><given-names>P van der</given-names></name><name><surname>Bussieck</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dirkse</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Steacy</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>GAMS User Guide v22.5</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.gams.com"/></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Natural Environment Research Council</collab></person-group><article-title>UK Land Cover Map 2000 (LCM2000)</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ceh.ac.uk/sections/seo/lcm2000_home.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Office for National Statistics</collab></person-group><article-title>Population density, 2002: Regional Trends 38</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.statistics.gov.uk/STATBASE/ssdataset.asp?vlnk=